docs {
  # Auth

  Sign-up and sign-in endpoints. Both return a JWT that expires after 30 days.

  Tokens contain `userEmail` and `userRole`. They do **not** contain `userId` - see the Forms folder notes.

  Each request saves the returned JWT to the `token` collection variable so the protected Forms requests can reuse it.
}
